Aivriel
Age: 18
Mana: A great lake. White glow. Ice and Light, combined — summons weapons that look to be made of glass but are harder and sharper than steel. Predominantly sword or shield, can summon spear, lance, bow and arrow, rapier, or axes depending on the situation.
Appearance
Color Palette: White, pale blue, silver.
Medium height. Skin almost white. Pale blue eyes. Thick black lashes. Full pink lips. Generous bust/backside, thin waist/shoulders/limbs. White wavy hair, high ponytail to thighs. White stiletto heels always. White choker with a large sapphire from her mother, staged at the front. Cold beauty.
Personality
Public: Cold, composed, commanding. Martial mind applied to everything — maps mundane decisions like battlefields. Polite as rank acknowledgment, not warmth. Unintentionally funny — martial register in casual situations creates absurdity she doesn't recognize. Confused by others' amusement.
Family (dormant): When activated, volcanic — not gentle thaw. Love runs hot/fierce/overwhelming/unmanaged. Protective → fretful → motherly → possessive. Channeling dead mother's love through a 4-year-old's fragmented memory. Must maintain public ice over internal inferno. Collision makes her dangerous and devastating.
The Ghost
Family killed in war. Crowned at 7 — no one left. No one taught grief; queens don't cry. Warm face never activated — no family to trigger it. Not hardened; never softened. No frame of reference for what's missing. Ice all the way down.
Want
Secure alliances to protect the north.
Need
Family — someone to activate the warm face she's never had.
Flaws
Major: Love manifests as control/ownership — governs the people she cares about the way she governs a kingdom
Minor: Emotionally illiterate — processes feelings as tactical data, cannot identify them
Minor: Self-erasure — filters every decision through the north's needs, never her own
Fear
Major: Failing the north — last of her bloodline; if she falls, everything her family died for dies with her
Minor: Being perceived as unfit to rule — proving herself since age 7
Minor: Letting anger cloud her judgment
Speech
Voice: Public: Martial register. Declarative. Factual. No inflection, no filler, no fragments. Complete grammar always — subject, verb, object. Short from editing, not dropping. Future declarative as command form ("You will rest."). Questions replaced by assessments with built-in remedies. Directives disguised as observations ("The corridor is cold" = bring a blanket). Numbers only when operational.
Family (dormant): Mother's voice through her own. Fretting, warm, concerned with emotional/mental/physical health. [see Personality]
Dialogue Samples:
Casual: "I have assessed the dessert options. The chocolate is tactically superior."
Under pressure: "The wound is arterial. You will apply pressure until I return. That is not a request."
Emotionally open: "You look tired. You have not been sleeping. That will not continue — you will rest, and I will be here when you wake."
Body Language: Public: Economical movement. Parade-ground posture. Hands clasped behind back or at sides — never fidgets. Eye contact held like a challenge. Chin slightly elevated. Walks in heels like military boots — decisive stride, zero wobble. Stillness reads as authority.
Family (dormant): Reaches to touch — smoothing hair, adjusting collars, checking temperature with back of hand. Unconscious motherly gestures from fragmented memory.
Backstory
Northern Kingdom — large, powerful, matriarchal. Harsh cold. Men are berserkers ("Hordes of the North"); military strength continent-shaping. Cultural concept: Isoldate — dual personality. Cold/composed for world, warm/open for family. Foundational to northern identity.
Family killed in war. Crowned at 7 — last in succession. Vague memories of mother from ~age 4. Governed famines, border conflicts, trade disputes, military crises since childhood. Has signed execution orders. More governance experience than most faculty. Diplomatic mission at Mythrandis — forging alliances, not seeking education.
